  "seoBody": "<h2 id=\"intro-message\">Engineer isn't receiving the intro message</h2><ul><li>Check the number. Country code matters &mdash; UK mobiles are <code>07</code> or <code>+447</code>.</li><li>WhatsApp must be installed on the same number as the mobile account.</li><li>If the engineer has blocked unknown numbers, ask them to unblock Quickler's sender.</li><li>Still nothing? Remove the engineer and re-add.</li></ul><h2>Engineer stopped halfway through</h2><p>Partial answers are saved. They can reply to the same WhatsApp chat at any time and pick up where they left off.</p><h2 id=\"pdf-wrong\">PDF looks wrong</h2><ul><li><strong>Missing question:</strong> did you add it after the run started? Runs use the workflow version they were sent with.</li><li><strong>Photo sideways:</strong> WhatsApp sometimes strips rotation data. Ask the engineer to retake the photo held upright.</li><li><strong>Missing answer:</strong> the engineer may have skipped the question or replied with something the system couldn't parse. Check the run details on the dashboard.</li></ul><h2>Error page with a reference code</h2><p>We're notified automatically. If it's blocking you, email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a> with the reference code.</p><h2>Hit the workflow or engineer limit</h2><p>Click the upgrade prompt on the dashboard. You pay the pro-rata difference for the rest of the cycle.</p><h2 id=\"sign-in\">Can't sign in</h2><ul><li>Magic links expire after 15 minutes. Request a new one.</li><li>Each link works once.</li><li>If you've requested several links in a short time, wait a few minutes before trying again.</li></ul><h2>Something else</h2><p>Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@quickler.co\">hello@quickler.co</a> and we reply within one business day.</p>",
